config MYMOUNTS
	tristate "Misc device mirroring /proc/mounts (mymounts)"
	default m
	help
	  Expose the current mount namespace's mount table through a
	  /dev/mymounts misc character device, similar to /proc/mounts.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called mymounts.
